    <entry>
        <title>The Shape of Absence</title>
        <author>
            <name>Ting Lu</name>
        </author>
        <link href="https://tingyinglu.com/the-shape-of-absence.html"/>
        <id>https://tingyinglu.com/the-shape-of-absence.html</id>
        <media:content url="https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/23/2025Mu-Diao_Wu-Xing-Zhi-Xing-The-Shape-of-Absence_029_Feature_683x500_01.jpg" medium="image" />
            <category term="works"/>
            <category term="wood"/>

        <updated>2026-09-14T08:39:45+08:00</updated>
            <summary type="html">
                <![CDATA[
                        <img src="https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/23/2025Mu-Diao_Wu-Xing-Zhi-Xing-The-Shape-of-Absence_029_Feature_683x500_01.jpg" alt="" />
                    ｜The Shape of Absence・無形之形｜ A girl wears a Viking helmet, symbol of&hellip;
                ]]>
            </summary>
        <content type="html">
            <![CDATA[
                    <p><img src="https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/23/2025Mu-Diao_Wu-Xing-Zhi-Xing-The-Shape-of-Absence_029_Feature_683x500_01.jpg" class="type:primaryImage" alt="" /></p>
                <p>｜The Shape of Absence・無形之形｜</p>
<p class="p1">A girl wears a Viking helmet, symbol of courage. In her arms is no real cat, but a silhouette rendered in Nashiji-urushi lacquer—a tribute to a cat who shared nearly twenty years of life. After her passing, memories flash like distant fireworks—brief, bright, and lingering. This shadow is more than a pet’s form; it marks the imprint of all we’ve loved and lost. When someone is gone, does love remain? This work quietly asks: what truly exists, and what is unseen yet endures? In loss, we search for meaning—and gather the courage to keep walking.</p>
<p class="p1">小女孩戴著象徵勇氣的維京帽，懷中所抱，並非真實之物，而是一道以梨子地漆描繪的貓影<span class="s1">——</span>一隻陪伴將近二十年的老貓。牠離開後，記憶如煙火乍現，殘光閃爍，卻揮之不去。這道剪影，不只是一隻貓的輪廓，更是每段逝去關係的痕跡。當摯愛不再，愛本身是否仍存在？什麼是真正的存在？什麼是無形卻永不消失的？在失去中尋找答案，從悲傷中汲取前行的勇氣。</p>
<p>W31 x D24 x H67 cm<br>Camphor wood, Gold leaf, Nashiji-urushi 樟木、金箔、梨子地漆</p>
